<h1 class="page-title">Social Media Production</h1>
<p class="standfirst">Social media content and strategy for artists.</p>

<h2>Wes Coeur</h2>
<p class="standfirst">Instagram &amp; TikTok &middot; 2026&ndash;</p>
<p>I help Melbourne artist <a href="https://open.spotify.com/artist/4zjTgLNIPksuxMXCKClne9">Wes Coeur</a> produce his social media content and plan the strategy behind it. Together we've grown his Instagram from 500 to 5,000 followers and his TikTok from nothing to 3,400, with many of his videos passing a million views on TikTok and Instagram.</p>
<p>The strategy is to let Wes be himself. His videos are about the things he genuinely cares about, so the audience they find shares his interests, and they're the people most likely to love his music: R&amp;B, soul and electro-pop that owes as much to Prince's romance as to Tyler, the Creator's playful weirdness. (Wes and I also frequently collaborate musically together: see <a href="/interests/music/">Music</a>.)</p>

